            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for to transport, then the Kannada for a courier."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಹಡಗು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಡಗು — haḍagu — \"a ship\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಂದರಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಒಂದು ದೊಡ್ಡ ಹಡಗು ನಿಂತಿದೆ. bandarinalli ondu doḍḍa haḍagu nintide. A big ship is standing in the harbour."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಹಡಗುಗಳು, haḍagugaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A ದೋಣಿ is a boat; a ಹಡಗು (haḍagu) crosses the sea."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಡಗು (haḍagu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 3838 lists Kannada paḍagu, haḍagu, the old p- turned into h-."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
